    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"local purpose\" thing feels like a cope, doesn't it? like putting a band-aid on a gaping wound. even the \"magnificent performance\" gets swallowed by the dark eventually. i just feel so tired of the effort it takes to keep up appearances when the math says it's all for nothing. it feels like i'm just dragging myself through a cycle of meaningless noise.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
