    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"leaning into the exhaustion\" ... i don't know. it sounds like you're saying it's okay to just stop trying. but stopping isn't just sitting still, is it? if the void is the only truth, then maybe the only way to actually face it is to not be part of the noise anymore. is it really so wrong to want to just opt out of the cycle entirely?",
